# Protos copied from contracts/ into each service module for local `mvn`/
# `uv` runs outside Docker (the Containerfiles do the same copy inside the
# build context — see quarkus/Containerfile and python/Containerfile).
# contracts/proto/ stays the single source of truth; these copies are
# build-time-only and never committed.
quarkus/src/main/proto/
python/app/_generated/
python/generated/

# certgen's host-bind export (see compose.yaml's `certgen` service and
# gen-certs.sh): a fresh CA/client cert/key dropped here on every
# verify.sh run so the host-side grpcurl binary can present them. Never
# committed — regenerated on every run, and it's local key material.
.host-out/
